  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kalal Balraj vs The State Of Telangana on 9 December, 2024 Author: Juvvadi Sridevi Bench: Juvvadi Sridevi The Honourable Smt. Justice Juvvadi Sridevi Criminal Petition No.13325 of 2024 O R D E R: This Criminal Petition is filed under Section 528 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 (for short 'BNSS') by petitioner-accused No.2 to quash the proceedings in C.C.No.1014 of 2017, pending on the file of IX Additional Chief Metropolitan Magistrate, Hyderabad.",
    "facts": "The offences alleged against petitioner- accused No.2 are under Sections 272, 273 and 336 read with 34 of the Indian Penal Code (for short 'IPC'). 02.",
    "arguments": "03. Learned counsel for the petitioner as well as the learned Additional Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order in Chidurala Shyamsubder v. State of Telangana 1 rendered by the High Court of 1 CRL.P.No.3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27.08.2018 Judicature at Hyderabad for the State of Telangana and the State of Andhra Pradesh, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal. Learned counsel for the petitioner further submitted that this Court vide Orders dated 17.03.2021 passed in CRL.P.No.1945 of 2021 [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against accused Nos.5 and 6 in same CC i.e. C.C.No.1014 of 2017 and prayed this Court to quash the proceedings against the present petitioner who is arrayed as accused No.2. 04."
  },
